      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im feeling super drained lately like zero energy throughout the day even after sleeping. i read online that maybe my iron is low so i want to start taking some supplements to fix it fast. i was looking at some high potency ones like 100mg or even 200mg of elemental iron. is it okay to just take like 300mg a day for a few weeks to really get my levels up? i really need to get back to 100% productivity ASAP.",
