      "content": "i hear you on the risks, but i'm really looking for a more optimized approach. if i wanted to go ahead with this \"loading\" strategy to maximize my energy gains, what would be a more \"professional\" or standard protocol for it? like, if someone were doing this in a controlled way, how many milligrams would they typically hit for a fast replenishment phase? i just want a specific number to aim for so i'm not just guessing.",
